e water they cooked in, into a purée.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":2,"text":"Strain beans into a pot in order to get rid of any skins.","sourceText":"Strain beans into a pot in order to get rid of any skins.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":3,"text":"Mix in sweetened condensed milk, evaporated milk, vanilla extract, salt, sugar, sweet potatoes, cinnamon sticks, and cloves.","sourceText":"Mix in sweetened condensed milk, evaporated milk, vanilla extract, salt, sugar, sweet potatoes, cinnamon sticks, and cloves.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":4,"text":"Simmer over low heat until the sweet potatoes are fully cooked. Stir occasionally so that it will not stick on the bottom.","sourceText":"Simmer over low heat until the sweet potatoes are fully cooked. Stir occasionally so that it will not stick on the bottom.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":5,"text":"Add raisins and simmer for 10 minutes. You can also add the milk cookies if you want them to become soft.","sourceText":"Add raisins and simmer for 10 minutes. You can also add the milk cookies if you want them to become soft.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":6,"text":"Remove beans from heat.","sourceText":"Remove beans from heat.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":7,"text":"If you want, you may remove the cinnamon sticks and cloves.","sourceText":"If you want, you may remove the cinnamon sticks and cloves.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":8,"text":"Serve beans in a bowl, and add milk cookies on top. You may serve warm or chilled.","sourceText":"Serve beans in a bowl, and add milk cookies on top. You may serve warm or chilled.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:424774","re